### ============================================================
### NoCap Eats — Full End-to-End Manual Test
### All requests go through the API Gateway: http://localhost:5000
###
### EXECUTION ORDER:
###   Step 1  → Identity  (register & login 3 users)
###   Step 2  → Catalog   (create restaurant + menu)
###   Step 3  → Order     (place + advance order)
###   Step 4  → Delivery  (accept + deliver)
###
### HOW TO RUN (VS Code REST Client / Rider .http):
###   Execute each ### block top-to-bottom.
###   After each login, copy the token into the variable below it.
### ============================================================

@gateway = http://localhost:5000

# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# STEP 1 — IDENTITY
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### [1.1] Register Customer
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Jane Customer",
  "email": "jane@nocap.com",
  "password": "Password1",
  "mobileNumber": "+1234567890",
  "role": "Customer"
}

### [1.2] Register Restaurant Owner
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Bob Owner",
  "email": "bob@nocap.com",
  "password": "Password1",
  "mobileNumber": "+0987654321",
  "role": "RestaurantOwner"
}

### [1.3] Register Delivery Agent
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Dave Agent",
  "email": "dave@nocap.com",
  "password": "Password1",
  "mobileNumber": "+1122334455",
  "role": "DeliveryAgent"
}

### [1.4] Login as Customer  ← copy accessToken below
# @name customerLogin
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jane@nocap.com",
  "password": "Password1"
}

@customerToken = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### [1.5] Login as Owner  ← copy accessToken below
# @name ownerLogin
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bob@nocap.com",
  "password": "Password1"
}

@ownerToken = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE
@ownerId    = PASTE_USER_ID_HERE

### [1.6] Login as Agent  ← copy accessToken below
# @name agentLogin
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "dave@nocap.com",
  "password": "Password1"
}

@agentToken = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### [1.7] Get own profile  → 200 with user details
GET {{gateway}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### [1.8] No token  → 401
GET {{gateway}}/api/auth/me


# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# STEP 2 — CATALOG
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### [2.1] Browse restaurants (empty)  → 200 []
GET {{gateway}}/api/restaurants

### [2.2] Create restaurant  → 201
# @name createRestaurant
POST {{gateway}}/api/owner/restaurants
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

{
  "name": "Bob's Gourmet Burgers",
  "description": "Award-winning burgers",
  "address": "123 Main Street",
  "city": "London",
  "phone": "+44123456789",
  "cuisineType": "American"
}

@restaurantId = PASTE_RESTAURANT_ID_HERE

### [2.3] Create customer tries owner endpoint  → 403
POST {{gateway}}/api/owner/restaurants
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

{
  "name": "Sneaky",
  "description": "test",
  "address": "addr",
  "city": "city",
  "phone": "+1234567890",
  "cuisineType": null
}

### [2.4] Add "Burgers" category  → 201
# @name createCategory
POST {{gateway}}/api/owner/restaurants/{{restaurantId}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

{
  "name": "Burgers",
  "description": "Signature burgers",
  "sortOrder": 1
}

@categoryId = PASTE_CATEGORY_ID_HERE

### [2.5] Add menu item  → 201
# @name createItem
POST {{gateway}}/api/owner/restaurants/{{restaurantId}}/categories/{{categoryId}}/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

{
  "name": "Classic Burger",
  "description": "Beef patty, cheese, lettuce",
  "price": 12.99
}

@menuItemId = PASTE_MENU_ITEM_ID_HERE

### [2.6] Get my restaurants  → 200 [1 restaurant]
GET {{gateway}}/api/owner/restaurants
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}


# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# STEP 3 — ORDERS
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### [3.1] Place order  → 201
# @name placeOrder
POST {{gateway}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

{
  "restaurantId": "{{restaurantId}}",
  "customerName": "Jane Customer",
  "customerPhone": "+1234567890",
  "deliveryAddress": "789 Customer Lane, London",
  "deliveryNotes": "Leave at door",
  "items": [
    {
      "menuItemId": "{{menuItemId}}",
      "name": "Classic Burger",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 12.99
    }
  ]
}

@orderId = PASTE_ORDER_ID_HERE

### [3.2] Customer views own orders  → 200 [Pending]
GET {{gateway}}/api/orders/my
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### [3.3] Restaurant views incoming orders  → 200 [1 order, Pending]
GET {{gateway}}/api/restaurant-orders/{{restaurantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### [3.4] Confirm order (Pending → Confirmed)  → 200
PUT {{gateway}}/api/restaurant-orders/{{orderId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

{ "status": 1 }

### [3.5] Start preparing (Confirmed → Preparing)  → 200
PUT {{gateway}}/api/restaurant-orders/{{orderId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

{ "status": 2 }

### [3.6] Ready for pickup (Preparing → ReadyForPickup)  → 200
PUT {{gateway}}/api/restaurant-orders/{{orderId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

{ "status": 3 }

### [3.7] Bad transition (ReadyForPickup → Delivered, skips agent)  → 409
PUT {{gateway}}/api/restaurant-orders/{{orderId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

{ "status": 5 }

### [3.8] Customer tries to cancel after ReadyForPickup  → 409
POST {{gateway}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}


# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# STEP 4 — DELIVERY
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### [4.1] Agent sees pending deliveries  → 200 [1 delivery created by consumer]
GET {{gateway}}/api/deliveries/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}

@deliveryId = PASTE_DELIVERY_ID_HERE

### [4.2] Customer tries delivery endpoint  → 403
GET {{gateway}}/api/deliveries/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### [4.3] Agent accepts delivery  → 200 (status: Assigned)
POST {{gateway}}/api/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}

### [4.4] Agent accepts same delivery again  → 409 Conflict
POST {{gateway}}/api/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}

### [4.5] Mark picked up (Assigned → PickedUp)  → 200
PUT {{gateway}}/api/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}

{ "status": 2 }

### [4.6] Mark delivered (PickedUp → Delivered)  → 200
PUT {{gateway}}/api/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}

{ "status": 3 }

### [4.7] Verify agent's delivery history  → 200 [1 delivery, Delivered]
GET {{gateway}}/api/deliveries/my
Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}

### [4.8] Notification health check  → 200 { status: "healthy" }
GET {{gateway}}/notification/health
